<mxfile host="Electron" agent="Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) draw.io/29.3.6 Chrome/140.0.7339.249 Electron/38.8.0 Safari/537.36" version="29.3.6">
  <diagram name="Page-1" id="FCycd7i7Kj4KPFHwJoKc">
    <mxGraphModel dx="2695" dy="1625" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="0" pageScale="1" pageWidth="850" pageHeight="1100" math="0" shadow="0">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <mxCell id="b3HQe4iItPejWAHVR6H--1" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" value="Experiment-9:-&amp;nbsp; To design and develop a &lt;strong data-start=&quot;148&quot; data-end=&quot;173&quot;&gt;Ticket Booking System&lt;/strong&gt; that enables users to efficiently discover, select, and purchase tickets for various entertainment services such as movies, concerts, and live events, while ensuring secure transactions, real-time availability management, and an intuitive user experience." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="30" width="1020" x="-390" y="-120" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="b3HQe4iItPejWAHVR6H--2" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" value="&lt;b&gt;A. Functional Requirements -&lt;/b&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="30" width="170" x="-390" y="-70" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="b3HQe4iItPejWAHVR6H--3" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;rounded=0;" value="1.&amp;nbsp;The system shall allow users to search events using filters such as event title, location, and date.&lt;div&gt;2. The users should be able to do registration and login.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;3.&amp;nbsp;The system shall provide detailed event information including seat availability, description, and metadata.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;4. The user gets the real time avaiaiable seats and layout of theatre hall so the user can book their seats.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;5. The user should make a payment to book the seats and additional add on&#39;s and packages.&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="80" width="720" x="-390" y="-40" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="b3HQe4iItPejWAHVR6H--6" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;rounded=0;" value="&lt;b&gt;B. Non Functional Requirements :-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;1.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;The system shall be designed to handle &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;231&quot; data-end=&quot;277&quot; style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;up to 100 million daily active users (DAU)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt; with horizontal scalability.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;2.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;The system shall ensure &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;336&quot; data-end=&quot;357&quot; style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;high availability&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt; for event search and browsing operations, minimizing downtime.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;3. The system shall ensure &lt;strong data-start=&quot;566&quot; data-end=&quot;588&quot;&gt;strong consistency&lt;/strong&gt; during ticket booking transactions to prevent double booking.&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;4.&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;The system shall support &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;790&quot; data-end=&quot;819&quot; style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;high concurrency handling&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt; for simultaneous users accessing and booking tickets so no two users book&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;same seat.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;5. The system should be &lt;b&gt;consistent&lt;/b&gt; during the transactions handling of multiple users.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;6. The system is able to handle &lt;b&gt;fault tolerance&lt;/b&gt; situation.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="140" width="740" x="-390" y="50" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="b3HQe4iItPejWAHVR6H--7" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;rounded=0;" value="&lt;b&gt;C. API Design&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;1. Users :-&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 13px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 13px;&quot;&gt;a) POST:-&amp;nbsp;&lt;span data-start=&quot;1582&quot; data-end=&quot;1606&quot; style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;/users/register&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 13px;&quot;&gt;b) POST :- /users/login&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 13px;&quot;&gt;c) GET :- /users/{userID}&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 13px;&quot;&gt;d) GET :- /users/{userID}/bookings&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;-&amp;gt; [ Get the booking history]&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 13px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 13px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 13px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;2. Event Discovery :-&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 13px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 13px;&quot;&gt;a) GET :- /events/{filter}&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;-&amp;gt; [Get the list of all the events based on the query param filter]&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 13px;&quot;&gt;b) GET - /events/{eventId} -&amp;gt; [Get the particular event]&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 13px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 13px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;3. Seat Managements APIs :-&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 13px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 13px;&quot;&gt;a)&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;550&quot; data-end=&quot;581&quot; style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;GET /events/{eventId}/seats&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt; → Fetch seat layout and availability&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 13px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;b)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;677&quot; data-end=&quot;697&quot; style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;POST /seats/lock&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt; → Temporarily lock selected seats&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 13px;&quot;&gt;c)&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;835&quot; data-end=&quot;858&quot; style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;POST /seats/release&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt; → Release locked seats (timeout or manual)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 13px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 13px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 13px;&quot;&gt;4. Booking and Payment APIs :-&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 13px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 13px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;a)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;946&quot; data-end=&quot;964&quot; style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;POST /bookings&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt; → Create a booking (after seat lock)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 13px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;b)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1325&quot; data-end=&quot;1354&quot; style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;GET /bookings/{bookingId}&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt; → Fetch booking details&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 13px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 13px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 13px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;5. Notification APIs:-&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 13px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 13px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;a)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1418&quot; data-end=&quot;1446&quot; style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;POST /notifications/send&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt; → Send booking confirmation (Email/SMS)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;b) POST/notificatins/trending&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;→&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Send the latest information about trending movies.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="520" width="700" x="-390" y="200" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="b3HQe4iItPejWAHVR6H--8" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;rounded=0;" value="&lt;b&gt;D. Core Entities :-&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;1. Users&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;2. Events&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;3. Venue&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;4. Seat&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;5. Booking&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;6. Payment&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;7. Notification&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="150" width="400" x="-390" y="730" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="b3HQe4iItPejWAHVR6H--9" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;rounded=0;" value="&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 13px;&quot;&gt;E. Database schema design&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 13px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 13px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 13px;&quot;&gt;1. Users table :-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 13px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 13px;&quot;&gt;Users (&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 13px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; user_id&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; BIGINT PRIMARY KEY,&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 13px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; name&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;VARCHAR(100),&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 13px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; email&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; VARCHAR(150) UNIQUE,&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 13px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; phone&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; VARCHAR(15),&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 13px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; password_hash&amp;nbsp; VARCHAR(255),&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 13px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; created_at&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;TIMESTAMP&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 13px;&quot;&gt;)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 13px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 13px;&quot;&gt;2. Events Table -&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 13px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 13px;&quot;&gt;Users (&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 13px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; user_id&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; BIGINT PRIMARY KEY,&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 13px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; name&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;VARCHAR(100),&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 13px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; email&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; VARCHAR(150) UNIQUE,&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 13px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; phone&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; VARCHAR(15),&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 13px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; password_hash&amp;nbsp; VARCHAR(255),&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 13px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; created_at&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;TIMESTAMP&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 13px;&quot;&gt;)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 13px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 13px;&quot;&gt;3. Venues Table :-&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 13px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 13px;&quot;&gt;Venues (&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 13px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; venue_id&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;BIGINT PRIMARY KEY,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 13px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; name&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;VARCHAR(150),&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 13px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; city&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;VARCHAR(100),&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 13px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; address&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; TEXT,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 13px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; capacity&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;INT&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 13px;&quot;&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 13px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 13px;&quot;&gt;4. Seats Table :-&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 13px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 13px;&quot;&gt;Seats (&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 13px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; seat_id&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;BIGINT PRIMARY KEY,&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 13px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; venue_id&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; BIGINT,&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 13px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; seat_number VARCHAR(10),&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 13px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; seat_type&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;VARCHAR(20),&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 13px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; price&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;DECIMAL(10,2),&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 13px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; FOREIGN KEY (venue_id) REFERENCES Venues(venue_id)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 13px;&quot;&gt;)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 13px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 13px;&quot;&gt;5. Shows Table :-&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 13px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 13px;&quot;&gt;Shows (&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 13px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; show_id&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;BIGINT PRIMARY KEY,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 13px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; event_id&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; BIGINT,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 13px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; venue_id&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; BIGINT,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 13px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; start_time&amp;nbsp; TIMESTAMP,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 13px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; end_time&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; TIMESTAMP,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 13px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; FOREIGN KEY (event_id) REFERENCES Events(event_id),&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 13px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; FOREIGN KEY (venue_id) REFERENCES Venues(venue_id)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 13px;&quot;&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 13px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 13px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 13px;&quot;&gt;6. Seat Inventory Table :-&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 13px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 13px;&quot;&gt;Seat_Inventory (&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 13px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; seat_id&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; BIGINT,&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 13px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; show_id&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; BIGINT,&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 13px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; status&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;VARCHAR(20), -- available / locked / booked&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 13px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; lock_expiry_time TIMESTAMP,&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 13px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; PRIMARY KEY (seat_id, show_id),&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 13px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; FOREIGN KEY (seat_id) REFERENCES Seats(seat_id),&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 13px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; FOREIGN KEY (show_id) REFERENCES Shows(show_id)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 13px;&quot;&gt;)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 13px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 13px;&quot;&gt;7. Bookings Table :-&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 13px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 13px;&quot;&gt;Bookings (&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 13px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; booking_id&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;BIGINT PRIMARY KEY,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 13px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; user_id&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; BIGINT,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 13px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; show_id&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; BIGINT,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 13px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; total_amount DECIMAL(10,2),&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 13px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; status&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;VARCHAR(20), -- pending / confirmed / cancelled&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 13px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; created_at&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;TIMESTAMP,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 13px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; FOREIGN KEY (user_id) REFERENCES Users(user_id),&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 13px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; FOREIGN KEY (show_id) REFERENCES Shows(show_id)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 13px;&quot;&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
